        "TileImage": "$($repository 3f808b28-3647-44f3-9aeb-4d5ae6d63573).Image",
        "Description": "Nov. 15, 2006.\r\rMilton-Fitzpatrick Bank, Manhattan, New York City, State of NY.\r\rCiao, agente 47. Today the next stronzi are Francesco &quot;Frank&quot; Morocco, Angelo Giliberto, Scotto Baratta, Nataniele &quot;Nate&quot; Bravo &amp; Joseph &quot;Josue&quot; Federico. Kill those stronzi and anyone who stands in the way. 47, I have almost discovered the names of the three main enemies, and when I have they will be killed after the other enemies have been killed. After today there is only ten nemici left.\r\rGrazie mille.",
